# `flutter test` golden diffs. These are gitignored build debris, but
# `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` for `dart pub publish` rather than
# stacking on it, so they have to be excluded here as well.
test/**/failures/
# The TDD lane. Its `lib/tdd/**` subjects drive widget tests and so import
# `flutter_test`, a dev dependency; the acceptance tests in `test/tdd/**`
# import those subjects back through `package:zuraffa_ui/tdd/...`. Both are
# local scaffolding, so the published archive ships neither: consumers never
# resolve test-runner code, and pana sees no test-only import under `lib/`.
lib/tdd
test/tdd
